WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,600
Dual jobs: The original agreement on paper was that it was an ordinary duel.

2
00:00:04,600 --> 00:00:06,400
Why don't you dare

3
00:00:06,400 --> 00:00:10,200
Spearhead boy, I will teach you how to improve your memory today.

4
00:00:10,200 --> 00:00:19,320
Sister Ji, believe me

5
00:00:19,320 --> 00:00:24,210
Owing the certificate of life and death, I went to the thunder platform

6
00:00:24,210 --> 00:00:26,210
No one can save you after you hit the killer three times

7
00:00:26,210 --> 00:00:30,780
Remember, if you can’t win, leave Yanwutai and admit defeat.

8
00:00:30,780 --> 00:00:32,980
This way Hou San won’t be able to continue attacking you.

9
00:00:32,980 --> 00:00:34,880
I won't lose

10
00:00:34,880 --> 00:00:57,670
Read the appointment and communicate clearly in private

11
00:00:57,670 --> 00:01:00,070
If it is meaningless, the game starts

12
00:01:00,070 --> 00:01:03,130
Both sides take their positions and the duel begins
